What the license covers

  "The Software" is this site's code: its layouts, components, styles and
  scripts. Take it, change it, build your own site with it.

What it does not cover

  My writing, my about page, my resume, my name, pictures of me, and Playmatter's
  images and video are not part of the Software and are not licensed for reuse.
  If you fork this, replace them with your own.

  The typefaces have their own license, the SIL Open Font License. See
  src/assets/fonts/.

What I ask of you

  Don't pretend to be me. Don't publish a copy that still presents itself as
  Charlotte or as bybrooklyn.dev.

  Don't use my name, or this site's, to suggest I endorse or had a hand in what
  you make.

  Don't put words in my mouth. Don't change my writing and leave my name on it,
  or attribute to me things I didn't say.

  Don't use this to hurt people. Not to harass anyone, and not against trans or
  queer people.

  These are requests, not license conditions. I'm trusting you with them.
